menu "CSI transmitter"

    config CSI_TX_FREQUENCY_HZ
        int "Frames per second"
        range 1 500
        default 100
        help
            Must divide CONFIG_FREERTOS_HZ (1000) evenly, otherwise the build fails.
            Allowed examples: 20, 25, 40, 50, 100, 200, 250, 500.

endmenu
